{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"mana_crystal","model_identifier":"mana_crystal","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## mana_crystal\n\nSmall prop, magic.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (1 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.2..2.5, y -2.2..7.2, z -1.2..1.2 (size 3.7 x 9.5 x 2.4 u = 10 x 27 x 7 cm).\nMana crystal: a tall cyan crystal shard with a side spur (one rotated cube) on a crumb of black volcanic rock; the crystal cubes are `glow_*` so the game can light them cyan. ~25 cm. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 2.2.\n"},"description":"## mana_crystal\n\nSmall prop, magic.\n\n- Cubes: 4 (1 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 32x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -1.2..2.5, y -2.2..7.2, z -1.2..1.2 (size 3.7 x 9.5 x 2.4 u = 10 x 27 x 7 cm).\nMana crystal: a tall cyan crystal shard with a side spur (one rotated cube) on a crumb of black volcanic rock; the crystal cubes are `glow_*` so the game can light them cyan. ~25 cm. Origin = the grip in **slot_hand_r** (or slot_hand_l). To stand it on the ground as a pile/prop, place the origin at y = 2.2.\n","resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"glow_crystal","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-0.9,-1.5,-0.9],"to":[0.9,6.0,0.9],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0,0,1.8,7.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[2,0,3.8,7.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[4,0,5.8,7.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[6,0,7.8,7.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[18,0,19.8,1.8],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[20,0,21.8,1.8],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"b9c9f3c6-6551-54ec-a348-80c39e479ced"},{"name":"glow_tip","box_uv":false,